---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Reviews
description: Reviews from clients of Hafez Fandy, each one linked to its source.
permalink: /reviews/
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow">Reviews</p>
    <h1 class="h-xl" style="max-width:16ch">What clients say.</h1>
    <p class="lead">Every review here was written by the client and published with their permission. Where it also lives on Clutch, Google or LinkedIn, you can read it there too.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section aria-label="Client reviews">
  <div class="container">
    {% if collections.reviews.length %}
    <div class="review-grid">
      {% for review in collections.reviews %}
      {% include "partials/review-card.njk" %}
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    {% else %}
    <div class="empty-state">
      <h2>No reviews published yet.</h2>
      <p>Client reviews will appear here once projects are delivered and clients have agreed to share them. Until then, the <a class="text-link" href="/work/">work</a> speaks for itself.</p>
    </div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</section>
